{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976","id":4813706902,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7uE3i3","number":120976,"title":"GDScript: Make language shutdown more crash resilient","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":8,"created_at":"2026-07-05T17:06:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T16:07:34Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T15:44:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120976","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120976.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-13T15:44:20Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106401\r\n- Supersedes and closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118191 (which was missing the graceful pass to clear static data)\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119279\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/68009 (had to slightly adapt the MRP to get things running. With the adapted MRP before this PR there are leaked string names. With the adapted MRP and this PR no string names are leaked. One orphan node is reported, hower this is a user error, which results from registering a `Node` with `Engine.register_singleton`. The docs for `remove_singleton` explicitly state \"The singleton object is not freed.\")\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102569 due to cleaning up static vars before invalidating the updatable function pointer.\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86540\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe GDScript shutdown is now structured in multiple passes. Each of which are clearing up certain stuff.\r\n\r\n- The first pass only clears static variables, and ensures that correct user code does receive `NOTIFICATION_PREDELETE`\r\n- The second pass cancels all pending functions and partially destructs remaining instances. Both of those are user errors at this point so no one gets notified about anything.\r\n- The last pass clears up all internal references among GDScripts and removes the GDScript resources from our bookkeeping.\r\n\r\nFor all `RefCounted` classes that we do not have full control on (`GDScript`, `GDScriptFunctionState`), we now have a `clear` function to \"partially destruct\" them (as in: clearing up their internal state). Those classes can now be correctly destructed even after `GDScriptLanguage::singleton` is gone, as long as we cleared them properly beforehand.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- I did play through the first few levels of Rift Riff (quitting the game between levels). While the game still leaks a lot of objects, I don't see an increase (maybe a slight decrease compared to 4.7, but it might just be normal variance). None of the `GDScript bug (please report)` checks from this PR did occur, neither did a crash.\r\n\r\n- Did play through Dogwalk without issues.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120976/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}